```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Nora, I think you've got the right approach waiting on the recipe card details before finalizing. From my end, the key things I'll be looking for are whether the lentil pie uses a wheat-based crust or any flour as a thickener — if so, we'd need a gluten-free alternative like a rice flour or almond flour crust. And Tessa's sesame concern is just as critical. If the recipe can be adapted for both, great — but if it can't safely accommodate both needs, I'd want us to have a backup main dish option so nobody is left out at Aunt June's celebration. I'm happy to help with the labeling system on Sunday morning when we arrive for the 11:00 setup — I can bring some label cards and markers so each dish gets both ingredient info and its dedicated serving utensil clearly marked."}
